            <!-- =========================
                 SUMMARY
            ========================== -->

            <div class="alert alert-info mt-4 mb-0"
                 style="background-color:#cfe2ff; border:0; color:#123c73;">

                <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mt-0 mb-3"
                    style="color:#123c73;">

                    Summary :

                </h2>

                <p class="mb-0"
                   style="color:#123c73;">

                    In Python, the <strong>return</strong> statement sends the result from a function back to the caller.
                    The returned value can be stored in a variable and used for further calculations, conditions, and other functions.
                    Python functions can return a single value as well as multiple values, lists, and dictionaries.

                </p>

            </div>


